{
  "id": "RPA_1egodkc",
  "name": "",
  "executionPlatform": "Camunda Cloud",
  "executionPlatformVersion": "8.9.0",
  "script": "*** Settings ***\nLibrary    Camunda\nLibrary    OutlookLibrary\n\nTask Setup       Prepare Test\nTask Teardown    Close Outlook\n\n\n*** Tasks ***\nOutlook Email E2E Test\n    ${testId}=                 Set Variable    ${EMPTY}\n    ${subject}=                Set Variable    ${EMPTY}\n    ${recipient}=              Set Variable    ahmad325issa@hotmail.com\n\n    ${workerUser}=             Set Variable    ${EMPTY}\n    ${workerHost}=             Set Variable    ${EMPTY}\n    ${workerIpAddress}=        Set Variable    ${EMPTY}\n\n    ${outlookTitle}=           Set Variable    ${EMPTY}\n    ${composeTitle}=           Set Variable    ${EMPTY}\n\n    ${onboardingHandled}=      Set Variable    ${False}\n    ${licensePopupHandled}=    Set Variable    ${False}\n    ${readonlyPopupHandled}=   Set Variable    ${False}\n\n    ${testResult}=             Set Variable    PASS\n    ${errorType}=              Set Variable    ${EMPTY}\n    ${errorMessage}=           Set Variable    ${EMPTY}\n\n    ${emailSent}=              Set Variable    ${False}\n    ${emailReceived}=          Set Variable    ${False}\n\n    ${totalDuration}=          Set Variable    ${0.0}\n    ${deliveryDuration}=       Set Variable    ${0.0}\n\n    ${testStart}=    Evaluate    __import__('time').perf_counter()\n\n    TRY\n        # -----------------------------------------------------\n        # Test-ID\n        # -----------------------------------------------------\n        Log To Console    [RPA] Generate Test Id\n        ${testId}=    Generate Test Id\n\n\n        # -----------------------------------------------------\n        # Worker-Metadaten\n        # -----------------------------------------------------\n        Log To Console    [RPA] Get Execution Environment\n        ${environment}=    Get Execution Environment\n\n        ${workerUser}=    Set Variable\n        ...    ${environment}[username]\n\n        ${workerHost}=    Set Variable\n        ...    ${environment}[hostname]\n\n        ${workerIpAddress}=    Set Variable\n        ...    ${environment}[ipAddress]\n\n\n        # -----------------------------------------------------\n        # Outlook genau EINMAL starten\n        # -----------------------------------------------------\n        Log To Console    [RPA] Open Outlook\n        ${outlookTitle}=    Open Outlook\n\n\n        # -----------------------------------------------------\n        # Bekannte Popup-Fenster behandeln\n        # -----------------------------------------------------\n        Log To Console    [RPA] Prepare Outlook Ui\n        ${uiPreparation}=    Prepare Outlook Ui\n\n        ${onboardingHandled}=    Set Variable\n        ...    ${uiPreparation}[onboardingHandled]\n\n        ${licensePopupHandled}=    Set Variable\n        ...    ${uiPreparation}[licensePopupHandled]\n\n        ${readonlyPopupHandled}=    Set Variable\n        ...    ${uiPreparation}[readonlyPopupHandled]\n\n\n        # -----------------------------------------------------\n        # Eigentliche E2E-Messung beginnt hier\n        # -----------------------------------------------------\n        ${e2eStart}=    Evaluate    __import__('time').perf_counter()\n\n\n        # -----------------------------------------------------\n        # Mail vorbereiten\n        # -----------------------------------------------------\n        ${subject}=    Set Variable\n        ...    Camunda RPA E2E ${testId}\n\n        ${composeTitle}=    Open New Email\n\n        ${result}=    Fill Outlook Email\n        ...    recipient=${recipient}\n        ...    cc=${recipient}\n        ...    subject=${subject}\n        ...    body=Automatisierter Camunda RPA E2E Test. Test ID: ${testId}\n\n\n        # -----------------------------------------------------\n        # Mail senden\n        # -----------------------------------------------------\n        ${sendResult}=    Send Outlook Email\n\n        ${emailSent}=    Set Variable\n        ...    ${sendResult}[sent]\n\n\n        # -----------------------------------------------------\n        # Mail empfangen\n        # -----------------------------------------------------\n        ${receiveResult}=    Wait For Outlook Email\n        ...    ${subject}\n        ...    ${sendResult}[sendStarted]\n        ...    timeout=90\n\n        ${emailReceived}=    Set Variable\n        ...    ${receiveResult}[received]\n\n        ${deliveryDuration}=    Set Variable\n        ...    ${receiveResult}[deliveryDurationSeconds]\n\n\n        # -----------------------------------------------------\n        # Gesamtdauer\n        # -----------------------------------------------------\n        ${e2eEnd}=    Evaluate    __import__('time').perf_counter()\n\n        ${totalDuration}=    Evaluate\n        ...    round(${e2eEnd} - ${e2eStart}, 3)\n\n\n        # -----------------------------------------------------\n        # Fachliche Validierung\n        # -----------------------------------------------------\n        IF    not $emailSent or not $emailReceived\n            ${testResult}=    Set Variable    FAIL\n            ${errorType}=     Set Variable    TestAssertionError\n            ${errorMessage}=  Set Variable    Outlook email send/receive validation failed.\n        END\n\n\n    EXCEPT    AS    ${error}\n        ${testResult}=    Set Variable    FAIL\n\n        ${errorMessage}=    Convert To String    ${error}\n\n        ${errorType}=    Evaluate\n        ...    str($errorMessage).split(':', 1)[0] if ':' in str($errorMessage) else 'TestExecutionError'\n\n        ${testEnd}=    Evaluate    __import__('time').perf_counter()\n\n        ${totalDuration}=    Evaluate\n        ...    round(${testEnd} - ${testStart}, 3)\n\n\n    FINALLY\n        Set Output Variable    testId    ${testId}\n        Set Output Variable    subject    ${subject}\n        Set Output Variable    recipient    ${recipient}\n\n        Set Output Variable    workerUser    ${workerUser}\n        Set Output Variable    workerHost    ${workerHost}\n        Set Output Variable    workerIpAddress    ${workerIpAddress}\n\n        Set Output Variable    testResult    ${testResult}\n        Set Output Variable    errorType    ${errorType}\n        Set Output Variable    errorMessage    ${errorMessage}\n\n        Set Output Variable    emailSent    ${emailSent}\n        Set Output Variable    emailReceived    ${emailReceived}\n\n        Set Output Variable\n        ...    onboardingPopupHandled\n        ...    ${onboardingHandled}\n\n        Set Output Variable\n        ...    licensePopupHandled\n        ...    ${licensePopupHandled}\n\n        Set Output Variable\n        ...    readonlyPopupHandled\n        ...    ${readonlyPopupHandled}\n\n        Set Output Variable\n        ...    outlookWindowTitle\n        ...    ${outlookTitle}\n\n        Set Output Variable\n        ...    composeWindowTitle\n        ...    ${composeTitle}\n\n        Set Output Variable\n        ...    deliveryDurationSeconds\n        ...    ${deliveryDuration}\n\n        Set Output Variable\n        ...    totalE2EDurationSeconds\n        ...    ${totalDuration}\n\n    END\n\n\n*** Keywords ***\nPrepare Test\n    Log To Console    [SETUP] Ensure Outlook Closed START\n    Ensure Outlook Closed\n    Log To Console    [SETUP] Ensure Outlook Closed DONE"
}